hardQ1 DB 0DH,0AH,"1) What are used as soul container?$"
hardQ2 DB 0DH,0AH,"2) The three magical objects together is called?$"
hardQ3 DB 0DH,0AH,"3) Which spell summons objects to the caster?$"
